	</head>
	<body>
		<header class="nav wrap">
			<a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="GERAK beranda"><span>G</span>GERAK</a>
			<nav aria-label="Navigasi utama"><a href="#program">Program</a><a href="#cara">Cara mulai</a><a href="#progres">Progres</a></nav>
			<a class="nav-cta" href="#program">Mulai latihan <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
		</header>

		<main id="top">
			<section class="hero wrap">
				<div class="hero-copy">
					<p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Gerak sekarang, bukan nanti</p>
					<h1>Badan lebih kuat.<br /><em>Dari rumah.</em></h1>
					<p class="lead">Workout efektif tanpa alat, tanpa biaya, tanpa alasan. Pilih program dan mulai bergerak dalam hitungan detik.</p>
					<div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#program">Lihat program <span>↓</span></a><button class="button ghost" id="quick-start" type="button"><span class="play">▶</span> Latihan cepat 10 menit</button></div>
					<div class="trust"><div class="faces" aria-hidden="true"><span>AR</span><span>DN</span><span>SF</span><span>+</span></div><p><strong>2.400+ orang</strong><br />sudah mulai bergerak</p></div>
				</div>
				<div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Ilustrasi latihan squat">
					<div class="sun"></div><div class="figure"><div class="head"></div><div class="hair"></div><div class="body"></div><div class="arm left"></div><div class="arm right"></div><div class="leg left"></div><div class="leg right"></div></div>
					<div class="stat stat-time"><span>◷</span><div><strong>15</strong><small>MENIT / HARI</small></div></div><div class="stat stat-place"><span>⌂</span><div><strong>0</strong><small>ALAT DIBUTUHKAN</small></div></div><p class="scribble">ruang kecil,<br /><b>hasil besar!</b></p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="ticker" aria-label="Keunggulan"><div>LATIHAN GRATIS <b>✦</b> TANPA ALAT <b>✦</b> SEMUA LEVEL <b>✦</b> BISA DI MANA SAJA <b>✦</b> LATIHAN GRATIS <b>✦</b> TANPA ALAT</div></section>

			<section class="programs wrap" id="program">
				<div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Pilih ritmemu</p><h2>Program latihan</h2></div><p>Tak perlu sempurna. Cukup mulai dari level yang terasa pas hari ini.</p></div>
				<div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter program"><button class="active" data-filter="Semua" type="button">Semua</button><button data-filter="Pemula" type="button">Pemula</button><button data-filter="Menengah" type="button">Menengah</button><button data-filter="Lanjutan" type="button">Lanjutan</button></div>
				<div class="grid">
					{workouts.map((workout, index) => (
						<article class={`card ${workout.color}`} data-level={workout.level} data-id={workout.id}>
							<div class="card-top"><span class="number">0{index + 1}</span><span class="tag">{workout.level}</span></div><div class="mini-figure" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i><b></b></div>
							<div class="card-body"><p>{workout.focus}</p><h3>{workout.title}</h3><div class="meta"><span>◷ {workout.duration} menit</span><span>↻ {workout.rounds} ronde</span></div><div class="card-actions"><button class="details-workout" type="button">Detail</button><button class="start-workout" type="button">Mulai latihan <span>→</span></button></div></div>
						</article>
					))}
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="how" id="cara"><div class="wrap">
				<div class="section-head light"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Gampang dimulai</p><h2>Tiga langkah.<br /><em>Langsung keringetan.</em></h2></div></div>
				<div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><span>↙</span><h3>Pilih program</h3><p>Sesuaikan durasi dan level dengan kondisi tubuhmu.</p></div><div><b>02</b><span>▶</span><h3>Ikuti timer</h3><p>Gerak 30 detik, istirahat 15 detik. Ulangi.</p></div><div><b>03</b><span>✓</span><h3>Catat progres</h3><p>Selesaikan latihan dan bangun konsistensi harian.</p></div></div>
			</div></section>

			<section class="progress wrap" id="progres">
				<div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Progres minggu ini</p><h2>Konsisten lebih penting<br />daripada sempurna.</h2><p>Setiap latihan selesai otomatis tersimpan di perangkat ini.</p></div>
				<div class="progress-card"><div class="progress-title"><div><small>LATIHAN SELESAI</small><strong id="completed-count">0</strong><span> / <b id="weekly-goal">4</b> minggu ini</span></div><span class="bolt">ϟ</span></div><div class="bar"><span id="progress-bar"></span></div><div class="days">{['S', 'S', 'R', 'K', 'J', 'S', 'M'].map((day, index) => <div data-day={index}><i>✓</i><span>{day}</span></div>)}</div><div class="progress-stats"><span><b id="streak-count">0</b> hari streak</span><span><b id="total-minutes">0</b> total menit</span></div><div class="progress-controls"><label>Target <select id="goal-select"><option>3</option><option selected>4</option><option>5</option><option>7</option></select> / minggu</label><button id="export-progress" type="button">Export data</button><button id="reset-progress" type="button">Reset</button></div></div>
			</section>
			<section class="safety wrap"><strong>⚠ Dengarkan tubuhmu.</strong><span>Berhenti bila terasa nyeri tajam, pusing, atau sesak. Konsultasikan kondisi medis dengan tenaga kesehatan sebelum mulai.</span></section>
		</main>

		<footer><div class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="#top"><span>G</span>GERAK</a><p>Gerak kecil hari ini. Badan kuat esok hari.</p><div class="footer-actions"><button id="share-site" type="button">Bagikan</button><small>© 2026 GERAK</small></div></div></footer>

		<dialog id="onboarding-modal"><button class="close close-onboarding" aria-label="Tutup" type="button">×</button><p class="modal-kicker">MULAI DARI SINI</p><h2>Temukan latihanmu</h2><p>Jawab tiga hal. GERAK pilihkan titik mulai yang pas.</p><label>Level <select id="pref-level"><option>Pemula</option><option>Menengah</option><option>Lanjutan</option></select></label><label>Target <select id="pref-focus"><option>Seluruh tubuh</option><option>Core</option><option>Kardio</option><option>Mobilitas</option><option>Kekuatan</option></select></label><label>Waktu <select id="pref-duration"><option value="10">10 menit</option><option value="15">15 menit</option><option value="20">20 menit</option><option value="30">30 menit</option></select></label><button id="recommend" class="button primary" type="button">Rekomendasikan →</button></dialog>
		<dialog id="detail-modal"><button class="close close-detail" aria-label="Tutup" type="button">×</button><p class="modal-kicker">TENTANG PROGRAM</p><h2 id="detail-title"></h2><p id="detail-target"></p><div class="program-summary"><span id="detail-duration"></span><span id="detail-rounds"></span></div><div class="detail-box"><strong>Tips program</strong><span id="detail-tip"></span></div><div class="exercise-list" id="exercise-list"></div><div class="modal-actions"><button id="detail-start" class="button primary" type="button">Mulai latihan</button><button id="detail-share" class="button ghost" type="button">Bagikan</button></div></dialog>
		<dialog id="workout-modal"><button class="close" id="close-modal" aria-label="Tutup" type="button">×</button><p class="modal-kicker" id="phase-label">LATIHAN BERLANGSUNG</p><h2 id="modal-title">Full Body Starter</h2><div class="round" id="round-label">Ronde 1 / 3</div><label class="interval-choice">Interval <select id="interval-choice"><option value="20,10">20 / 10</option><option value="30,15" selected>30 / 15</option><option value="40,20">40 / 20</option></select></label><div class="timer-ring"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="53"></circle><circle id="timer-progress" cx="60" cy="60" r="53"></circle></svg><strong id="timer">30</strong><span>DETIK</span></div><h3 id="exercise-name">Jumping Jack</h3><p id="timer-status">Siap? Tekan mulai.</p><details class="active-guide"><summary>Cara melakukan</summary><p id="active-steps"></p><small id="active-avoid"></small></details><div class="modal-actions"><button id="timer-toggle" class="button primary" type="button">Mulai</button><button id="timer-skip" class="button ghost" type="button">Lewati →</button></div></dialog>

		<script define:vars={{ workouts, exerciseGuide }}>
			const modal = document.querySelector('#workout-modal');
			const timerText = document.querySelector('#timer'), timerProgress = document.querySelector('#timer-progress');
			const title = document.querySelector('#modal-title'), exerciseName = document.querySelector('#exercise-name');
			const roundLabel = document.querySelector('#round-label'), status = document.querySelector('#timer-status');
			const toggle = document.querySelector('#timer-toggle'), phaseLabel = document.querySelector('#phase-label');
			const showExerciseGuide = name => { const guide = exerciseGuide[name]; document.querySelector('#active-steps').textContent = guide.steps; document.querySelector('#active-avoid').textContent = `Hindari: ${guide.avoid}`; };
			let selected, interval, phase = 'work', seconds = 30, exerciseIndex = 0, round = 1, running = false, workSeconds = 30, restSeconds = 15;
			const json = (key, fallback) => { try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key) || JSON.stringify(fallback)); } catch { return fallback; } };
			const updateProgress = () => {
				const completed = json('gerak-progress', []), history = json('gerak-history', []), goal = Number(localStorage.getItem('gerak-goal') || 4);
				document.querySelector('#completed-count').textContent = completed.length;
				document.querySelector('#weekly-goal').textContent = goal; document.querySelector('#goal-select').value = goal;
				document.querySelector('#progress-bar').style.width = `${Math.min(completed.length / goal * 100, 100)}%`;
				document.querySelectorAll('.days div').forEach((day, index) => day.classList.toggle('done', completed.includes(index)));
				document.querySelector('#total-minutes').textContent = history.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.minutes, 0);
				const dates = [...new Set(history.map(item => item.date))].sort().reverse(); let streak = 0, cursor = new Date();
				while (dates.includes(cursor.toISOString().slice(0, 10))) { streak++; cursor.setDate(cursor.getDate() - 1); }
				document.querySelector('#streak-count').textContent = streak;
			};
			const speak = text => { if ('speechSynthesis' in window) { speechSynthesis.cancel(); speechSynthesis.speak(new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text)); } };
			const renderTimer = () => { timerText.textContent = seconds; timerProgress.style.strokeDashoffset = 333 - (333 * seconds / (phase === 'work' ? workSeconds : restSeconds)); };
			const finish = () => {
				clearInterval(interval); running = false;
				const completed = json('gerak-progress', []), today = new Date().getDay(), dayIndex = today === 0 ? 6 : today - 1;
				if (!completed.includes(dayIndex)) completed.push(dayIndex);
				localStorage.setItem('gerak-progress', JSON.stringify(completed)); localStorage.setItem('gerak-last-workout', new Date().toISOString());
				const history = json('gerak-history', []); history.push({ date: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10), workout: selected.title, minutes: selected.duration }); localStorage.setItem('gerak-history', JSON.stringify(history)); updateProgress();
				title.textContent = 'Latihan selesai!'; exerciseName.textContent = 'Kerja bagus.'; status.textContent = 'Satu langkah lebih kuat dari kemarin.'; toggle.textContent = 'Tutup'; toggle.dataset.finished = 'true'; speak('Latihan selesai. Kerja bagus.');
			};
			const nextExercise = () => {
				phase = 'work'; exerciseIndex++;
				if (exerciseIndex >= selected.exercises.length) { exerciseIndex = 0; round++; }
				if (round > selected.rounds) return finish();
				seconds = workSeconds; phaseLabel.textContent = 'LATIHAN BERLANGSUNG'; exerciseName.textContent = selected.exercises[exerciseIndex]; showExerciseGuide(selected.exercises[exerciseIndex]); roundLabel.textContent = `Ronde ${round} / ${selected.rounds}`; status.textContent = 'Jaga napas. Kamu bisa.'; renderTimer(); speak(selected.exercises[exerciseIndex]);
			};
			const rest = () => { phase = 'rest'; seconds = restSeconds; phaseLabel.textContent = 'ISTIRAHAT'; exerciseName.textContent = 'Tarik napas'; status.textContent = 'Siapkan gerakan berikutnya.'; renderTimer(); speak('Istirahat'); };
			const openWorkout = id => {
				selected = workouts.find(item => item.id === id) || workouts[1]; clearInterval(interval); running = false; phase = 'work'; seconds = workSeconds; exerciseIndex = 0; round = 1;
				title.textContent = selected.title; phaseLabel.textContent = 'LATIHAN BERLANGSUNG'; exerciseName.textContent = selected.exercises[0]; showExerciseGuide(selected.exercises[0]); roundLabel.textContent = `Ronde 1 / ${selected.rounds}`; status.textContent = 'Siap? Tekan mulai.'; toggle.textContent = 'Mulai'; delete toggle.dataset.finished; renderTimer(); modal.showModal();
			};
			const detailModal = document.querySelector('#detail-modal');
			const showDetail = id => {
				const item = workouts.find(workout => workout.id === id); detailModal.dataset.id = id;
				document.querySelector('#detail-title').textContent = item.title; document.querySelector('#detail-target').textContent = `Target utama: ${item.target}`; document.querySelector('#detail-tip').textContent = item.tip;
				document.querySelector('#detail-duration').textContent = `◷ ${item.duration} menit`; document.querySelector('#detail-rounds').textContent = `↻ ${item.rounds} ronde`;
				document.querySelector('#exercise-list').innerHTML = item.exercises.map((name, index) => { const guide = exerciseGuide[name]; return `<details><summary><b>0${index + 1}</b><span><strong>${name}</strong><small>${guide.target}</small></span></summary><div class="exercise-guide"><p>${guide.steps}</p><p><b>Napas:</b> ${guide.breath}</p><p><b>Hindari:</b> ${guide.avoid}</p><p><b>Modifikasi:</b> ${guide.easier}</p></div></details>`; }).join('');
				detailModal.showModal();
			};
			document.querySelectorAll('.start-workout').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => openWorkout(button.closest('.card').dataset.id)));
			document.querySelectorAll('.details-workout').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => showDetail(button.closest('.card').dataset.id)));
			document.querySelector('#quick-start').addEventListener('click', () => openWorkout('core'));
			document.querySelector('#close-modal').addEventListener('click', () => { clearInterval(interval); running = false; modal.close(); });
			document.querySelector('.close-detail').addEventListener('click', () => detailModal.close());
			document.querySelector('#detail-start').addEventListener('click', () => { detailModal.close(); openWorkout(detailModal.dataset.id); });
			document.querySelector('#detail-share').addEventListener('click', () => share(`Coba program ${document.querySelector('#detail-title').textContent} di GERAK`));
			document.querySelector('#timer-skip').addEventListener('click', nextExercise);
			document.querySelector('#interval-choice').addEventListener('change', event => { [workSeconds, restSeconds] = event.target.value.split(',').map(Number); if (!running) { seconds = workSeconds; phase = 'work'; renderTimer(); } });
			toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
				if (toggle.dataset.finished) return modal.close();
				running = !running; toggle.textContent = running ? 'Jeda' : 'Lanjut'; status.textContent = running ? 'Terus bergerak!' : 'Dijeda.'; clearInterval(interval);
				if (running) interval = setInterval(() => { seconds--; renderTimer(); if (seconds <= 0) { if (phase === 'work') rest(); else nextExercise(); } }, 1000);
			});
			document.querySelectorAll('.filters button').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => { document.querySelectorAll('.filters button').forEach(item => item.classList.remove('active')); button.classList.add('active'); document.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach(card => card.hidden = button.dataset.filter !== 'Semua' && card.dataset.level !== button.dataset.filter); }));
			document.querySelector('#goal-select').addEventListener('change', event => { localStorage.setItem('gerak-goal', event.target.value); updateProgress(); });
			document.querySelector('#export-progress').addEventListener('click', () => { const blob = new Blob([JSON.stringify(json('gerak-history', []), null, 2)], { type: 'application/json' }); const link = Object.assign(document.createElement('a'), { href: URL.createObjectURL(blob), download: 'gerak-progress.json' }); link.click(); URL.revokeObjectURL(link.href); });
			document.querySelector('#reset-progress').addEventListener('click', () => { localStorage.removeItem('gerak-progress'); localStorage.removeItem('gerak-history'); localStorage.removeItem('gerak-last-workout'); updateProgress(); });
			const share = async text => { if (navigator.share) await navigator.share({ title: 'GERAK', text, url: location.href }); else await navigator.clipboard?.writeText(`${text} ${location.href}`); };
			document.querySelector('#share-site').addEventListener('click', () => share('Workout di rumah tanpa alat — GERAK'));
			const onboarding = document.querySelector('#onboarding-modal');
			document.querySelector('.close-onboarding').addEventListener('click', () => onboarding.close());
			document.querySelector('#recommend').addEventListener('click', () => { const level = document.querySelector('#pref-level').value, focus = document.querySelector('#pref-focus').value, duration = Number(document.querySelector('#pref-duration').value); const match = workouts.find(item => item.level === level && item.focus === focus) || workouts.find(item => item.level === level && item.duration <= duration) || workouts[0]; onboarding.close(); document.querySelector(`[data-id="${match.id}"]`).scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' }); showDetail(match.id); localStorage.setItem('gerak-preferences', JSON.stringify({ level, focus, duration })); });
			if (!localStorage.getItem('gerak-preferences')) setTimeout(() => onboarding.showModal(), 800);
			if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js').catch(() => {});
			updateProgress();
		</script>
